{"type": "mcq", "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"StartFraction 1 Over x EndFraction plus 8 equals one sixth plus 8\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">What is the solution to the given equation?</p>", "keys": ["c0f42d43-0456-4346-b1c4-c129656dd29e"], "answerOptions": [{"id": "f1753a2d-8b4d-4676-9500-d5dee0413cb5", "content": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><math alttext=\"1\"><mn>1</mn>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "c0f42d43-0456-4346-b1c4-c129656dd29e", "content": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><math alttext=\"6\"><mn>6</mn>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "dc7d3ca8-018c-4b7f-8ebf-6966abb66db7", "content": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><math alttext=\"8\"><mn>8</mn>\n</math></p>"}, {"id": "81fb1d85-3eeb-4d3b-9aae-f336f7833735", "content": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><math alttext=\"14\"><mn>14</mn>\n</math></p>"}], "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is correct. Subtracting <math alttext=\"8\"><mn>8</mn>\n</math> from each side of the given equation yields <math alttext=\"StartFraction 1 Over x EndFraction equals one sixth\"><mrow>\n<mfrac>\n<mn>1</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mfrac>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mfrac>\n<mn>1</mn>\n<mn>6</mn>\n</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Multiplying each side of this equation by <math alttext=\"6 x\"><mrow>\n<mn>6</mn>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math> yields <math alttext=\"6 equals x\"><mrow>\n<mn>6</mn>\n<mo>=</mo>\n<mi>x</mi>\n</mrow>\n</math>. Thus, the solution to the given equation is <math alttext=\"6\"><mn>6</mn>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect&nbsp;and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect&nbsp;and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect&nbsp;and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>", "externalid": "67266c3c-00b9-45bd-91e8-fbde7f826062", "correct_answer": ["B"]}